Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《电锯惊魂9：漩涡》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我的钱包他偷了我的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey  My purse  He's got my purse
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 拦住他 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop him   Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.79,0:01:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,来人拦住他他偷了我的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody stop him  He's got my purse
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,警察不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police  Freeze
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 站住别挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey  Stop  Out of my way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别挡路让开警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way  Out of my way  Police
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你小子不会是下去了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not just go down there...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.82,0:01:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,什么破事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your fucking hands in the air
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再说第二遍了混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't gonna say it again, motherfucker
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你好保斯维克警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Detective Bozwick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我想和你玩个游戏不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.  No
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.02,0:03:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,两分钟后三号线列车就要开过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 3 train is arriving in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,由你决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is up to you to decide
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:04:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不是你人生中的最后一站\N{\fnArial\fs30}if this will be your final stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾多次扮演目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have taken the witness stand many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,用你的谎言轻易制裁无辜的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and railroaded innocent people with your lies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们送入监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}putting them away in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,今天你将要受到制裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, it is you who will be railroaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你有一个活下去的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one chance to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你那经常用来撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tear from your mouth the tongue that has so often been used
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,的舌头现在是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}to lie and to deceive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,纵身一跃即可活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a leap of faith, and you will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你自身的重量能扯断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only your weight will rip away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你满是谎言的舌头保你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}your lying tongue and save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是生是死做出选择吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live or die, make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么那部电影获了很多奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you talking about  That movie won awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的汤姆汉克斯可不是什么好家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Tom Hanks is a straight pimp, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我怀疑现在还能拍出这种电影么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't know if you could make that movie today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你在扯什么东西呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck you going on about
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,特殊需求虐待 特殊需求?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special needs abuse. Special needs
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么你开悟了不是开悟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you woke now Not woke,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你不能叫别人残废也不能骂别人发育迟钝\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't say "handicapped," you can't say "retarded."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你得说他们情况特殊我试着放尊重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to say "special needs," I'm trying to be respectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,阿甘就是个有特殊需求的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forrest Gump was special needs, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那个女主角叫什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the name of the girl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny.  Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他做的一切都是为了珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did everything for Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这个混蛋做了许多不得了的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This motherfucker did some shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他进行了横穿全国的慢跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He jogged across the whole country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他打乒乓球击败了中国队\N{\fnArial\fs30}He beat China in pingpong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这有多困难吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how fucking hard that shit is
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个战争英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a war hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能比阿甘更厉害?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck is nicer than Forrest Gump
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}His best friend
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一个是黑人另一个是失去双腿的白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a nigga and a white boy with no legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.43,0:06:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他通过捕虾成为了亿万富翁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made a billion dollars selling shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而她仍然不肯和阿甘睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she still wouldn't fuck him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 最终他们在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, eventually, they got together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是在女主角得了艾滋病之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, after she got AIDS.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她一得了艾滋病就开始勾引阿甘\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as she got AIDS, she's like, "Hey, Forrest..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快滚吧兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck out of here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,让他也感染了艾滋病?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving that guy AIDS
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑嘛 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me   Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋真的该骂 但是他没有感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shit's abusive.  But he ain't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没看到续集出来《阿甘正传》第二部呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't see no sequel. Where's Gump 2
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 里科刚从电梯里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Rico just got off the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:06:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.41,0:07:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,开千吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下趴下立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down  Get down right now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.85,0:07:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在趴下现在给我趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down right now  You know what this is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了都放进来快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right  Put it all  Come on  Down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,塞满这个包都给我放到包里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill up this bag  Put it in the motherfucking bag
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.19,0:07:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么样 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what to do   Chill
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要可卡因我想要钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that coke  I want that money
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everything
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,九十秒我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninety seconds, we gotta go
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,警察不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze  Police
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,举起手来把手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up  Get your hands up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,下车都给我下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the car. Get the fuck out of...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke  Is that you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.47,0:08:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你在搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is wrong with you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做潜伏任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do an undercover op...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白吗这事儿没法协调\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't clear it, there's no coordination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可是重案组\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are Homicide,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你却在旅馆里忙着打劫毒品贩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're robbing drug dealers in a fucking hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我这里接到一堆报警电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a dozen 911 calls come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有人被杀了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if someone got killed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那个团伙上周杀了四个人我们抓住了那帮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That crew killed four people last week, and we got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我的身份没有暴露还能抓住更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we could have got more of them if my cover wasn't blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,去你妈的身份泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck your cover, Zeke
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你还和以前一样独自行动没有后援什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were off on your own, as usual, no backup, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.49,0:09:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没有后援因为在警局里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No backup, 'cause there's nobody on the force
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没有我能信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can fucking trust
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,现在开始你要学会团队合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, you're going to learn to be a team player.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你将会得到一个搭档珍妮把申克叫进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting a partner. Jeannie, send Schenk in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我看起来像个带小孩的保姆吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like a fucking Jamaican nanny
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是乐意收拾烂摊子的人吗?不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I smell like jerk sauce and baby wipes  No
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要任何搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me no want no partner
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会去照顾哪个混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not babysitting some fucking rook.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不你必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你的老爸是大领导马库斯·班克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because your dad was Chief fucking Marcus Banks
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,并不意味着你就能不服从管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean you get out of the shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别提我的父亲行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop making this about my father, okay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经离职了你现在才是部门的老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone, you're the head of the department now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 戏精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Drama queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.61,0:09:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克已经过去12年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke, it's been 12 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 整整12年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes  Twelve fucking years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.61,0:09:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,12年前我揭发了一名黑警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve years ago, I turned in a dirty cop,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我因此获得了一枚奖章办了一件大案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get a medal for it. Big fucking deal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.49,0:09:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,同样我也中了一发子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also got a bullet,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,所以在我以后的职业生涯中我都得时刻注意背后暗箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got to look over my back for the rest of my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,听你鬼扯这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is too fucking hot in here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真他妈的让我火大\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me to listen to this bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我有棘手的事情要办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a heat wave going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得实行封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got rolling blackouts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这座城市要疯了停\N{\fnArial\fs30}the city is nuts. Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,队长你要见我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to see me, Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是的进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.51,0:10:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克见见我们的见习警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke, I want you to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉·申克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective in training, William Schenk.
