Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.62,0:34:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我在给孩子做入睡训练简直是噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're sleeptraining. It's a fucking nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.12,0:34:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,听着兄弟呃我知道你和保斯走得近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, um... I know you and Boz were close,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.20,0:34:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么跟你讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.00,0:34:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你有事想说说吧威廉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something to say, William, say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.75,0:34:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯我按你的要求去调查了公共记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm looking through all the Metro records like you asked,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.13,0:34:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,发现保斯被指控作伪证\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Boz was accused of lying on the stand more than anybody...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.21,0:34:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,长期滥用职权\N{\fnArial\fs30}by like a wide fucking margin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.47,0:34:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.22,0:35:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,法院\N{\fnArial\fs30}The courthouse...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.72,0:35:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是舌头被放在法院大楼的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why the tongue was at the courthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.81,0:35:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有事儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.23,0:35:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你是马库斯·班克斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Marcus Banks
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.77,0:35:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不我是他儿子 行这是泰罗尼的外卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm his son.  Well, Terroni delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.90,0:35:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哦行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.12,0:35:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.18,0:35:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,老爹你外卖在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop, got your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.20,0:36:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.83,0:36:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈怎么不先给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the fuck could you not call me first
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.12,0:36:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我打了你没接\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried, but you didn't answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.88,0:36:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,行那你怎么不等到我给你回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why didn't you wait for me to fucking call you back
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.71,0:36:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你会劝阻我\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you would have talked me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.75,0:36:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.05,0:36:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出我的视线泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck out of my face, Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.80,0:36:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我们单独谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get the room
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.97,0:36:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.27,0:36:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就知道不该让他当警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I should have never let him become a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.90,0:36:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这种破事传起来很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shit's gonna go sideways fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.27,0:36:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他检举了一个黑警察彼得是个小人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turned in a dirty cop. Pete was a scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.61,0:36:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,媒体会把他形容成英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press will make him out to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.94,0:36:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那其他警察呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the other cops
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.61,0:36:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他们也会叫他英雄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they're gonna call him a hero, too
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.12,0:36:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他做了正确的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.91,0:36:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我得做多少内部损耗控制的工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how much internal damage control I have to do
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.29,0:36:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能处理好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.16,0:36:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直都是如此不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We always do, huh
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.75,0:36:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,班克斯警长我是 WF Action新闻社的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Banks, WF Action News here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.76,0:37:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.01,0:37:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哦抱歉但我觉得你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry, but I think your face
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.31,0:37:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,擅自侵入了我的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}was trespassing on my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.98,0:37:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我能帮到你什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something I can help you with
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.98,0:37:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.31,0:37:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,行麻烦你滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Fuck you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.72,0:37:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,给警探泽克·班克斯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Detective Zeke Banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.81,0:37:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,班克斯给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banks, incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.31,0:37:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,放到我桌上现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my desk. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.94,0:37:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一个快递员送来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A courier brought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.14,0:37:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正扣下他问话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're holding him for questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.12,0:38:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你好警探班克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Detective Banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.12,0:38:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,救赎已经提供但却遭到拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salvation was offered, but it was declined.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.21,0:38:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这个混蛋当自己是竖锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fucker thinks he's Jigsaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.25,0:38:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这把都有玩偶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even got a doll this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.13,0:38:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我与警察局有些分歧争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a bone to pick with the police department,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.72,0:38:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们打算指手画脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you're going to point fingers...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.89,0:38:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,12号街的桥下我认识这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}12th Street Bridge. I know that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.68,0:38:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们最好该从自身开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you should start by pointing them at yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.89,0:38:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,老天那有两个街区远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez, that's two blocks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.43,0:38:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,直到你们坦白一切前还有很多人会牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you come clean, many more will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.24,0:38:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,待在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.75,0:39:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,保持警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.39,0:39:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,喔等等各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, hold it there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.12,0:39:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个变态啊兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a sick fuck, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.09,0:39:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.34,0:39:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哦不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.10,0:39:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God almighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.85,0:39:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,九八二\N{\fnArial\fs30}982.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.10,0:40:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是费奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Fitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.89,0:40:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是警探班克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Detective Banks
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.94,0:40:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,请求支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}requesting backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.36,0:40:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我在德克街请求支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on Decker Street. Request backup
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.77,0:40:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,去他的现在立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck him. In pursuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.07,0:40:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,请求支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}requesting backup
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.42,0:40:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊可恶我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, fuck   Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.09,0:40:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没事的保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be okay, stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.84,0:40:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事你会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good, you're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.14,0:40:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.30,0:40:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克先生拜托拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke   Sir  Please, please
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.51,0:40:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们做我们的工作拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us do our job, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.18,0:40:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托让我们完成我们的工作我们走我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let us do our jobs, let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.93,0:40:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都他妈上哪去了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck were all of you, huh
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.23,0:40:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子八分钟里叫了三次增援\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son called for backup three times in eight minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.82,0:40:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们他妈的一个都不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and none of you motherfuckers could get here
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.57,0:40:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没人一个也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody  Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.82,0:40:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,行好我接下来打算这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crickets. All right, this is what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.32,0:40:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上打电话给调遣部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to call Dispatch
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.33,0:41:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,找出谁是距离最近的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find out who was closest available,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.91,0:41:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等我找出是谁我会拿着这把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I do, I'm going to take this gun
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.33,0:41:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,射那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shoot that motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.04,0:41:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,听懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We clear
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.46,0:41:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,费奇是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fitch, it was you
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.51,0:41:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你又搞我儿子是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking with my son again
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.09,0:41:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,操你妈狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn you, son of a bitch
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.97,0:41:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.30,0:41:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你完了混蛋你听见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're done, motherfucker, you hear me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.55,0:41:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fucking done
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.18,0:41:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别再让我看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let me see your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.52,0:41:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,行了打给克劳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, call Kraus,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.98,0:41:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,找到费奇的最后地点在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}find out Fitch's last location.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.58,0:41:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你好费奇警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Detective Fitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.24,0:41:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我想和你玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.95,0:41:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,审判之潮正在上升\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tide of justice is rising around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.17,0:41:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在90秒内水位会上涨到\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 90 seconds, the water will rise
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.88,0:41:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,铜导线的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the height of the copper wires,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.05,0:41:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你仍在水池里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you are still in the tank,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.26,0:41:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你会被施以电刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will be electrocuted.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.18,0:42:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你做出牺牲以示忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you make the sacrifice that will cleanse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.30,0:42:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 哦 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}FITCH: God... Oh, God...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.10,0:42:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你谋杀了一个男人仅因为他辱骂了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You murdered a man because he insulted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.93,0:42:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的手放到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.39,0:42:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得见的位置混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I can see them, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.23,0:42:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我说把你的手放到我看得见的地方先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said put your hands where I can see them, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.44,0:42:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手指扣动了扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your finger pulled the trigger
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.45,0:42:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这不会再发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that cannot happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.57,0:42:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,存活很简单但它需要代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival is simple, but it comes with a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.41,0:42:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,咬下你嘴里的装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite down on the device in your mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.58,0:42:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,它会启动发动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}which will start the motor
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.17,0:42:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的手指撕掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will rip your fingers away...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.04,0:42:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还你自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}...leaving you free
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.50,0:42:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,逃回你的生活中\N{\fnArial\fs30}to escape with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.38,0:42:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你不迅速做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you don't act quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.26,0:42:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,等待你的结局就在这个浴缸里\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that awaits you is this watery tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.38,0:42:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,生存还是毁灭请做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live or die, make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.53,0:44:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳斯我们找到手指的那座桥有什么与众不同吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kraus, anything special about the bridge where we found the fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.28,0:44:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊为什么选那座桥啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, why that bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.08,0:44:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是在那座桥上枪杀吉米林肯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was where he shot that kid, Jimmy Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.54,0:44:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那你们是怎么找到这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how did you guys find out about this place
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.29,0:44:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这个本尼怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy, Benny Wrights,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.63,0:44:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就是保斯七月四号见到的最后一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who Boz was last seen with on July 4th.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.09,0:44:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道保斯最后见的谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know who Boz was last seen with
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.34,0:44:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从斯图亚茨角的一家当铺了解到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took it off a pawn shop feed in Stuart Point.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.80,0:44:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你没跟我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.09,0:44:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,到底谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck did this
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.72,0:44:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,估计是个伸张正义的城市警察吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody who has it out for the Metro PD.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.64,0:44:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是为了费奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe just for Fitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.23,0:44:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,德鲁里你有什么话就直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to say something, Drury
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.15,0:44:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我想说什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.44,0:44:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我怀疑就是你在给费奇打掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt you'll be shedding tears for Fitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.40,0:44:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好了别这样泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. Come on, Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.78,0:45:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.32,0:45:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了别理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.74,0:45:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你手头有什么线索了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get anything
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.70,0:45:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我手头有个名字本尼怀特这是保斯最后见的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a name. Benny Wrights. Last guy Boz was seen with.
