Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.17,0:45:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,本尼就是在这里搞到毒品的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is where Benny gets his meth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.46,0:45:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that is
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.63,0:45:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在测试我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a test
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.34,0:45:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,只是问个问题而已呃卖毒品的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just asking you a question.  Uh, it's a meth house.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.80,0:45:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你把钱放在桶里他们就把货给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put the money in the bucket, the meth comes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.76,0:45:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你看过《火线》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, somebody watched The Wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.10,0:45:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直和《万恶城市》里一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some New Jack City shit. Goddamn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.28,0:45:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不需要搜查令吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't we need a warrant for this
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.78,0:45:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么傻话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.32,0:45:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.70,0:45:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 好兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, my man, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.75,0:45:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,给点货给我和我马子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to get a five, me and my lady
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.46,0:45:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我俩周年纪念我们想庆祝一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our anniversary, we're trying to celebrate,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.62,0:45:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这个才够劲儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to do something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.88,0:46:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,给点吧 求你了 我把这个平板电脑给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get a five  How about this iPad
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.38,0:46:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这里面啥都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got everything on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.76,0:46:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,里面有 Passcodes, Netflix还有Hulu视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got passcodes, I got Netflix, Hulu,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.13,0:46:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你还可以直接在上面点餐你看吃的可多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, Uber Eats, Postmates. Lots of food, lots of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.43,0:46:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.01,0:46:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 快滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, man, get the fuck out of here.
