Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.48,0:46:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,平板里啥都有但是这个桶装不下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, yo, it got everything. It don't fit, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.23,0:46:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你下来一下可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come down
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.31,0:46:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.48,0:46:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等你有钱的时候再来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back when you get some money
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.90,0:46:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧好吧我需要钱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. I need money, I need money.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.44,0:46:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, wait, wait, wait
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.57,0:46:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有点钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got some, I got some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.74,0:46:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下我找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got some money, hold up a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.32,0:46:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就等一下好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up a second, all right
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.45,0:46:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好了快把货送下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, send it down, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.53,0:46:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快点快点我们等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.66,0:46:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,实在是等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.83,0:46:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke, what the fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.21,0:46:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,只有十秒钟快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got 10 seconds, come on
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.21,0:46:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.76,0:46:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,闪一边一别挡道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move   Get out of the way.
