Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.70,0:47:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这狗日的 嘿 别这么凶嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now   Hey, be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.70,0:47:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.41,0:47:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真他妈该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy fucking shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.54,0:47:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,发生怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck's going on
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.75,0:47:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,滚回去跟你没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back inside. Get back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.26,0:47:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,管好你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide your shit
