Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.43,0:47:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,操操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck. Fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.44,0:47:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我的腿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fucking leg
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.65,0:47:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么还要给我增加难度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you make this shit so hard
