Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.78,0:47:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,顾客就是上帝搞这么复杂干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to make it easy for the customer, skeeve
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.29,0:48:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我的腿啊我的腿断啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fucking leg
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.83,0:48:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这条腿已经没救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That leg is fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.54,0:48:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哟哟哟哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, yo, yo, yo
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.71,0:48:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来让我拍一张发朋友圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get a shot for the Gram.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.80,0:48:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个表情不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.59,0:48:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,日你妈别动别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}DRUG DEALER: What the fuck... Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.26,0:48:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我的好兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.55,0:48:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好了需要我艾特你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go  You want me to tag you
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.30,0:48:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,艾特你大爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck... Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.72,0:48:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要艾特你啊你这杂种我日你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I tag you, motherfucker   Fuck you...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.97,0:48:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前见过这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this man before
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.48,0:48:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个字也不会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't telling you shit
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.60,0:48:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你不说我就只好问问你的断腿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, 'cause you're worried about that bone sticking out your leg
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.90,0:48:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,来我来帮你消消毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you let me sterilize it
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.73,0:48:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不操\N{\fnArial\fs30}No... No... No  Fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.45,0:48:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,停停停求你了是本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Benny  Stop, please
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.70,0:48:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都认识那个该死的本尼怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knows that motherfucker Benny Wrights
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.96,0:48:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的客户之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of my best customers, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.92,0:48:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你最后一次见他是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you saw him
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.38,0:48:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经好几天没见过他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't seen the bitch in two days, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.79,0:48:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这条街上每个人都知道他吸毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word on the street is that motherfucker OD'd.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.93,0:48:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你成告密者了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.34,0:48:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.43,0:49:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这是在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.31,0:49:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,本尼已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we know Benny's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.85,0:49:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,买毒品可不是小打小闹得花不少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meth isn't the type of thing you take a break from.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.02,0:49:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你仔细看那个刑具没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, you see that device
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.07,0:49:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,牙齿不好都戴不上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not designed by anybody with rotten teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.45,0:49:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这个像不像竖锯的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think about this whole Jigsaw angle
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.53,0:49:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这应该是竖锯的门徒之一吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's a, whatdoyoucallthem, one of those disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.82,0:49:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰·克雷默不是冲着警察来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Kramer didn't target cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.62,0:49:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他另有目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did this has another motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.87,0:49:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是私人原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.41,0:49:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们应该不是受他人之命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're not following orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.00,0:49:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,况且竖锯早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially the orders of a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.34,0:49:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,或者根本没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.80,0:49:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在幕后操纵着这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody's out there pulling all the strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.72,0:49:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得之所以这些人给你寄来了盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this guy sent you the boxes
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.51,0:49:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你是这件案子的主要负责人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're the lead detective on the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.01,0:49:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能只是为了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or because you're you
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.55,0:49:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.89,0:49:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么死对头吗警察除外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got any enemies  That aren't cops
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.02,0:49:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么她就是不肯原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why she won't give me another chance.
