Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.69,0:49:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你有想过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever think of that
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.36,0:49:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你的爱实在是太沉重了这人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some tough love. Who the hell is this guy
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.82,0:49:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,前警察他的同伴出卖了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excop. Partner snitched on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.03,0:50:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,九年来他过得不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}had to do nine years hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.45,0:50:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,警局也不管他了现在他只能来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system spit him out, now here he is.
