Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.59,0:50:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.18,0:50:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你真晦气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last guy I expected to see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.10,0:50:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你来这醒酒的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to get sober
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.60,0:50:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我对酒不感冒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alcohol's not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.69,0:50:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是酒精和酒瓶可以杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The glass and the bottle can kill.
