Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.82,0:50:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,申克警探我们一起查这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Schenk. We're working a case together.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.74,0:50:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一起查案\N{\fnArial\fs30}PETE: Working together
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.08,0:50:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可别让这家伙抓住你的小辫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let this guy catch you jaywalking,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.62,0:50:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,保不准他让你直接身败名裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}or he'll stab you right in the fucking back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.12,0:50:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了彼得你自己把小辫子递我手里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget, Pete, you gave me the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.25,0:50:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.42,0:50:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定是这名警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you witnessed this cop
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.84,0:50:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把被害人从屋顶扔下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}throw the victim off a rooftop
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.59,0:50:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是亲眼所见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you saw it, I mean, with your own eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.96,0:50:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以指认这名警官吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can positively ID this cop
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.09,0:51:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经在这个社区横行霸道太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had his foot on the neck of this community for way too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.85,0:51:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们实在是受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.47,0:51:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我会当场指认他的邓利维警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll testify, Officer Dunleavy. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.48,0:51:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得彼得发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete  Pete  What happened  What happened
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.49,0:51:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚刚拿枪指着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He pulled a gun on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.66,0:51:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,目击者拿枪指着你你认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The witness pulled a gun on you
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.70,0:51:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我郁闷了很久但是我现在已经承担后果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was mad for a long time, but now I take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.58,0:51:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have never pulled the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.46,0:51:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙还有一大家子人等着他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy had a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.96,0:51:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,当时我真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was crazy back then, right
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.67,0:51:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在这种环境下生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were working under Article 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.55,0:51:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是身不由己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.59,0:51:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,面对犯罪的时候警察都有自己的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops were given their own discretion to crack down on crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.51,0:51:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你七月四号晚上九点半在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you July 4th at 9:30 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.56,0:51:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,讲真你就是为这事而来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really  That's what you're here for
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.52,0:51:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,对我就是为这事儿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.77,0:51:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,听着有几个家伙喝得醉醺醺的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, some guy came to a meeting drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.15,0:51:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一到这儿他们就胖揍了一个金主所以我就打回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wanted to fight a sponsor, so I hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.78,0:52:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,打得他妈都不认得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knocked him clean out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.86,0:52:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,然后警察来了而我现在还在缓刑期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, the cops came. I'm still on probation,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.91,0:52:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运的是奥布莱恩帮我摆平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but lucky for me, it was O'Brien.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.03,0:52:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,整件事情就过去了毕竟你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He let the whole thing slide because, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.50,0:52:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是讲情分的\N{\fnArial\fs30}loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.58,0:52:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,情分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.75,0:52:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,保重彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.13,0:52:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑你泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}God loves you, Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.80,0:52:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,会更保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.52,0:52:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我简直想不到那个家伙以前居然是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe that guy used to be a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.52,0:52:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因为他枪杀了一个无辜的男孩所以你就背叛了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shot an innocent guy, but you turned on him
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.52,0:52:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,当警察还是要讲原则你得学着适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a code, and you better learn how to follow it,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.57,0:52:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你这辈子都要担心有人会背后给你一刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're going to spend the rest of your life watching your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.86,0:52:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来很有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.03,0:52:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,或许咱俩搭档也不是什么坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a good thing they made us partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.16,0:52:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.74,0:52:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸我现在在你公寓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dad, I'm at your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.25,0:52:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨晚也来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was here last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.71,0:52:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来你一直没回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't look like you've been home.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.75,0:53:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有空就回我一个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.94,0:53:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你已接通威廉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotten through to William,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.23,0:53:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,请在滴声后留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave a message after the beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.07,0:53:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,申克现在已经九点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schenk, it's 9:00 a.m.,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.86,0:53:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你这小子在哪快给我回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the fuck are you  Give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.28,0:53:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我发生了什么好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}JEANNIE: Just tell me what happened, okay
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.91,0:53:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey  Hey  Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.99,0:53:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻把盒子放在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the box on the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.28,0:53:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,轻轻放在地上举起手来快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground  Hands up  Hands up
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.70,0:53:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,放在地上举起手来举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground now  Hands up, hands up
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.17,0:53:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.25,0:53:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,带他出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.13,0:53:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,带去拘留室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him to holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.34,0:53:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉班克斯我没注意到他就溜进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Banks, he blew right past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.72,0:53:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克别碰这个可能和之前的不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way, Zeke, that one is not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.10,0:53:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我在联系拆弹小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling the bomb squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.64,0:53:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,安吉你是我们的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angie, you're the head of the department.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.69,0:53:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经有两名警员牺牲了没有时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got two dead cops, there's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.94,0:54:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get everybody out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.73,0:54:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,出去出去大家都出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody out  Everybody out
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.36,0:54:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,走走走别待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, go
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.67,0:54:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈是人皮做的吗 呕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that fucking skin,  Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.84,0:54:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"班克斯警探我是不是把你惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Am I getting under your skin, Detective Banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.01,0:54:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,当你还在寻找尸体的下落时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, while you're looking for more bodies to drop,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.35,0:54:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,小心你项上人头"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'll take your head."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.65,0:54:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"项上人头...\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'll take your head...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.31,0:54:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是把你惹毛了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I getting under your skin".
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.12,0:54:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,家庭照片这是我妻子艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}...family. This is my wife, Emma,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.12,0:54:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is my son, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.29,0:55:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那他妈是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is that
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.92,0:55:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,队长那下面有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, there's something under here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.35,0:55:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,拜占庭颜料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Constantine Paints.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.29,0:55:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.37,0:55:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.38,0:55:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道这个地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'BRIEN: How do you know about this place
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.13,0:55:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克你是怎么知道这个地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke, how do you know about this place
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.47,0:55:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸以前总带我来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad used to take me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.26,0:55:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,各位注意脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your step, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.93,0:56:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿以前不是卖肉的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't always a butcher shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.19,0:56:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,以前是君土坦丁火车店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be Constantine Trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.31,0:56:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就和玩具店差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a hobby shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.25,0:56:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'BRIEN: Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.27,0:56:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.06,0:56:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在分析录音带\N{\fnArial\fs30}FORENSICS: Well, we're analyzing the tape recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.86,0:56:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,申克警探你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Detective Schenk,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.82,0:56:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我想玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.49,0:56:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你的成绩在警察学校名列前茅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were head of your class at the Police Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.45,0:56:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很明显他是在死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was obviously skinned...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.49,0:56:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,被剥皮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}postmortem.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.41,0:57:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我想这么做是因为你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's the reason I wanted to do this in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.00,0:57:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在他剥皮的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the body was scored first...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.29,0:57:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,先是把尸体划开将尸块切成条状\N{\fnArial\fs30}to remove the pieces in larger strips,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.92,0:57:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,然后对胳膊以及颈部进行剥皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}arms, neck, as he ripped the skin...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.80,0:57:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他们让你我成为搭档是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a good thing they made us partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.09,0:57:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体身上有搏斗留下的伤痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the defensive wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.38,0:57:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他显然试图反击过\N{\fnArial\fs30}he clearly tried to fight back,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.01,0:57:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这也解释了为什么他身上会有更深的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}which explains the deeper gashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.98,0:57:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,队长请问一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.31,0:57:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,作案的是一位针对警察的连环杀手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a serial killer targeting cops
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.15,0:57:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,受害者是警察队伍中的一员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the victim inside a policeman
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.07,0:57:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,无可奉告哈特局长今晚将发表声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}No comment. Commissioner Hart will make a statement tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.24,0:57:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在我把这件事告诉他妻子之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to try to keep his identity
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.12,0:57:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们要尽量保护他的身份不向媒体公开\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of the press until I tell his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.49,0:57:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,班克斯警探我是不是把你惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Am I getting under your skin, Detective Banks "
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.19,0:58:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,奥布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, O'Brien.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.48,0:58:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, boss
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.52,0:58:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看到泽克了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seen Zeke
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.86,0:58:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没有段时间没见着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.40,0:58:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好我要去处理个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm heading down to Cold Case.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.95,0:58:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.91,0:58:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要调用所有可用的人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need all available units,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.29,0:58:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在第三大道和 Beaman大街交汇处有警员负伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}officer down 3rd and Beaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.29,0:58:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,再次通报在第三大道和比曼大街交汇处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please report, 3rd and Beaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.52,0:58:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有什么线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.27,0:58:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,当时我正在贴罚单一个戴着猪头面具的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was writing a ticket and some guy in a pig's mask,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.10,0:58:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,拿刀向我冲过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}he runs up on me with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.52,0:58:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他捅了一下你的胳膊然后就跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he stabs your arm and just takes off
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.44,0:58:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽全力和他搏斗了然后他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fought him off the best I could and he...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.61,0:58:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他就这么逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took off running.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.32,0:58:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他有什么要袭击你的理由吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any reason he would have to attack you
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.36,0:59:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没有他就是想搅乱警察内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He just wanted to mess with the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.91,0:59:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,当你还在寻找尸体的下落时\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Careful, while you're looking for more bodies to drop,
