Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.92,1:12:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是找办法救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a way to save him,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.80,1:12:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还是扔掉钥匙让他自生自灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can keep him locked up and throw away the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.80,1:12:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,决定权在你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The decision is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.10,1:12:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,扔掉钥匙这他妈在说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Throw away the key," what the fuck
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.02,1:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.78,1:12:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快让我离开这个玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me the fuck out of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.33,1:12:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.75,1:13:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.21,1:13:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快点泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.09,1:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快点他妈放我下来泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me the fuck out of here, Zeke
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.47,1:13:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.90,1:13:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke  Help me
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.03,1:13:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.95,1:13:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,把我放下来求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me down, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.43,1:13:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.43,1:14:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.85,1:14:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,或者你可以锁着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}...or you can keep him locked up
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.02,1:14:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,并且把钥匙扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and throw away the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.79,1:14:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.04,1:14:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, Pete
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.35,1:14:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.52,1:14:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的打开了打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck. I got you, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.90,1:14:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,挺住啊彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.41,1:15:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.24,1:15:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.64,1:16:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个不讲信用的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disloyal piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.61,1:16:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,从我们相遇的第一天起我一直都对你讲信用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been loyal to you since the first day we met.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.28,1:16:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,十五年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.49,1:16:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那天你搭档杀了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day your partner killed my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.66,1:16:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那么查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.08,1:16:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见这名警察把受害者扔下屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}you saw this cop throw the victim off a rooftop,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.54,1:16:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,并且你能确认这名警察的身份对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can positively ID this cop
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.00,1:16:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我会作证的邓利维警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll testify, Officer Dunleavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.17,1:16:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我会作证的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.47,1:16:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得彼得发生什么了怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete  Pete  What happened, what happened
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.19,1:16:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他拿枪指着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He pulled a gun on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.44,1:16:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,目击者拿枪指着你?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The witness pulled a gun on you
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.49,1:17:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.74,1:17:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得杀了查理艾默森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete killed Charlie Emmerson.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.03,1:17:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?你以为我会用我的真名吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What  You thought I'd use my real name
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.24,1:17:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道要进入这个部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how hard it was
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.24,1:17:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还要被分配为你的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get placed in this department,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.00,1:17:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有多难吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get assigned to be your partner
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.42,1:17:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那你的家人呢?你的儿子呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your family, what about your son
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.25,1:17:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我儿子查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my son, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.42,1:17:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a son.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.76,1:17:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,查理正在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie's sleeping...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.22,1:17:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,当时正在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}...was sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.18,1:17:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,本尼赖特诱导保斯维克进入地铁隧道之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Benny Wrights led Boz down the subway tunnels...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.65,1:17:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我把我爸的名字纹在了他胳膊上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tattooed my dad's name on his arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.27,1:17:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸在哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my father
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.73,1:17:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你很快就会见到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see him soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.32,1:17:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸到底在哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck is my father
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.15,1:17:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至没叫他下来这里是你叫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even ask him to come down here. You did.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.78,1:17:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,把你电话借我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me borrow your phone, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.08,1:17:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.16,1:17:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.79,1:17:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别把手机玩没电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't drain my battery watching Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.72,1:18:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.77,1:18:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你不想听听我的提议吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to hear my offer
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.40,1:18:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我有选择吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have a choice
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.48,1:18:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟你合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be partners.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.11,1:18:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你选定了立场泽克反对黑警\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took a stand, Zeke, against a dirty cop,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.19,1:18:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而它给你带来了什么呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what did it get you
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.61,1:18:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,生都要提防着身后独自工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lifetime of watching your back, working alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.45,1:18:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,接听无家可归的流浪汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting the call for every homeless bum
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.33,1:18:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,被发现死亡的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}who turns up dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.08,1:18:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是让我们现实点吧这些混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, let's be real, some of these motherfuckers
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.16,1:18:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有一些纯粹就是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}are straight up evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.79,1:18:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,费奇不支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fitch not backing you up...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.79,1:18:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,去他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.59,1:18:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会再重复那个错误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't repeat that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.30,1:18:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还有保斯维克总是发了誓还撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Boz, always lying under oath...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.35,1:18:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你你不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, you're different.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.39,1:18:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你是片区里最好的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Metro's finest.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.18,1:18:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我想和你合作的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I want to team up with you on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.19,1:19:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你负责找出黑警我负责处理剩下的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find the dirty cops and I'll take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.48,1:19:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我帮你杀警察?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to help you kill cops
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.32,1:19:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不是当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, fuck no.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.65,1:19:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我只针对坏的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the bad ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.70,1:19:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰·克雷默是对的关于漩涡\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Kramer was right, the spiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.32,1:19:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一个变化进化和进步的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}A symbol of change, evolution, progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.49,1:19:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当你可以将它应用于整个系统时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why limit that to an individual
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.37,1:19:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要将其限制在个人身上呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you can apply it to a whole system
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.62,1:19:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你因为做了对的事情而中枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got shot for doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.88,1:19:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但让我们面对现实吧这些警察?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's face it, these cops
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.50,1:19:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是不会靠自己来整治腐败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not going to clean up on their own.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.80,1:19:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们带条舌头到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we take a tongue here,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.26,1:19:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,带些尸骨到这他们就会赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few bones there, they'll come around.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.72,1:19:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要修复一个破败的部门好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to fix a broken department. Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.85,1:19:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.39,1:19:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.68,1:19:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.52,1:19:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们来做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.19,1:19:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想信任你真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to trust you. I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.19,1:19:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我加入但你得放了我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in. But my dad goes free.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.49,1:19:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}One second.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.53,1:19:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是911请说明你的紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}911, please state your emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.83,1:19:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你好呃我在马迪根路的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, uh, I'm at the old soap factory
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.87,1:19:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,旧肥皂厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}on Madigan Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.33,1:19:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿有个拿枪的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a crazy guy with a gun,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.66,1:20:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他在到处开枪请快点赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's firing it everywhere. Please hurry
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.67,1:20:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那他妈的是哪一出?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck was that
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.38,1:20:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好快点泽克特警就在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hurry, Zeke, SWAT's on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.30,1:20:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,听着我想相信你我真的想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I want to believe you, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.30,1:20:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我想信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.51,1:20:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着这个你会用到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this, you'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.22,1:20:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,人走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.93,1:20:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去看看你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go see your dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.86,1:20:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候进行你的最后一场测试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for your final test.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.41,1:20:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.71,1:20:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,八泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.75,1:20:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的救他下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit  Get him down
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.55,1:20:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.89,1:20:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.22,1:20:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克儿子帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke. Help me, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.23,1:21:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.77,1:21:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让你死的我会救你下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to let you die. I will get you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.90,1:21:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题等等就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.28,1:21:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,现在向这混蛋开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot this motherfucker right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.78,1:21:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,救他下来现在救他下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him down  Get him down now
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.87,1:21:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为我们是搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were partners.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.83,1:21:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你想对我开枪是吗?泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You going to shoot me, Zeke
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.25,1:21:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就用你那一颗子弹吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your one bullet
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.54,1:21:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,馊主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.62,1:21:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这么做会害死你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kills your dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.92,1:21:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一下他朝我开了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took a shot at me, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.92,1:21:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没打中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.97,1:21:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我浪费了四发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasted four.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.68,1:21:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说明你只剩下一发了泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you got one shot left, Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.43,1:21:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧警察来了我们有四分钟的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, cops are here. That gives us four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.43,1:21:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道人体内有1.5加仑的血液吗?泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know there's 1.5 gallons of blood in the human body, Zeke
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.32,1:21:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,按照你那老父亲失血的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the rate your old man is bleeding out,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.48,1:21:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那些容器只需要不到三分钟就会填满\N{\fnArial\fs30}in just three minutes, those jars will be full
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.45,1:21:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你爸爸就会死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your dad will be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.32,1:21:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,能让他获救的唯一物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that can set him free
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.78,1:22:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你朝那个靶子射出的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the bullet in your gun fired at that target.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.79,1:22:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样我都有万无一失的方法能离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, I've got a foolproof way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.79,1:22:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是竖锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Jigsaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.58,1:22:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.75,1:22:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,打死我你们就都输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot me and you both lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.51,1:22:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,打靶子我们就都能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot the target and we both win.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.34,1:22:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你想玩吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to play
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.64,1:22:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我要死了泽克快动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dying, Zeke, end it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.31,1:22:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在这条走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this corridor.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.81,1:22:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,收到西南入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. Southwest entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.06,1:22:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,穿过南门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going through the south door.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.65,1:22:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有发现继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing here. Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.48,1:22:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你完全站在我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you all in.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.98,1:22:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,邓利维毁了我们俩的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dunleavy ruined both our lives
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.61,1:22:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你还想着帮那混蛋吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you tried to help that piece of shit
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.45,1:22:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke   Pete
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.70,1:22:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有通过测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You failed that test.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.62,1:22:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我需要你选择你和谁真正在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I need you to choose who you're really with.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.70,1:22:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个破坏了正义的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man who corrupted the force,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.66,1:22:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还是那个试图挽救一切的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the one who's trying to save it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.71,1:22:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你想告诉他吗?警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell him, Chief
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.38,1:22:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.09,1:22:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他你在第八修正案掩护下做的恶心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him about all the fucking shit you did under Article 8.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.88,1:22:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他在说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he talking about
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.51,1:22:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,时间在流逝 他在说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's running out.  What's he talking about
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.05,1:23:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,人们在死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Citizens were dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.39,1:23:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做了不得不做的事来清理街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did what we had to to clean up the streets.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.06,1:23:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候真是太疯狂了对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}PETE: It was crazy back then, right
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.94,1:23:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在第八修正案下工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were working under Article 8,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.98,1:23:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were out of control.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.40,1:23:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谋杀率大大下降了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder rate went way down.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.44,1:23:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那都是一派胡言\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fucking bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.53,1:23:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,人们再次感到安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}People felt safe again.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.36,1:23:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,街道变干净了因为警察变脏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The streets got cleaner because the cops got dirtier.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.82,1:23:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一下你爸爸目睹了全程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad oversaw the whole thing, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.70,1:23:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,无辜的人被枪杀全都是以正义的名义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocent people getting shot, all in the name of justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.62,1:23:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,第八修正案是警察政策历史上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Article 8 was one of the most corrupt
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.96,1:23:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,最腐败的修正案之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}police policies in history,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.87,1:23:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,猜猜你爸爸的得力助手是谁吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}and guess who was your dad's righthand man
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.58,1:23:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉也许我应该说女助手自始至终都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, or should I say woman, the whole time
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.50,1:23:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会处理好的一直以来都能不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll handle it. We always do, huh
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.55,1:23:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,安吉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angie
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.63,1:23:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,安吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angie
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.76,1:23:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是安吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Angie.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.43,1:23:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我是想说这也没多意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not a massive surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.68,1:23:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为是她的好名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it was her stellar reputation
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.60,1:23:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,让她在三十五岁的时候当上辖区警长的吗?拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}that got her a precinct at age 35  Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.51,1:23:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了这混蛋泽克就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot this piece of shit, Ezekiel. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.56,1:23:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是的没错因为那就是警察该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right, because that's what cops do.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.14,1:23:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,先开枪后问话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot first, ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.90,1:23:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你目睹了我父亲的死亡而我想救你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You watched my father die and I'm trying to save yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.11,1:23:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们互相信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're going to trust each other,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.99,1:23:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.53,1:24:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.95,1:24:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你过去总是做正确的事现在动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always done the right thing, do it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.00,1:24:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这个混蛋在杀害警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}This piece of shit is killing cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.54,1:24:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你仍然需要做出决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still need to decide,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.42,1:24:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以朝我开枪或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can shoot me, or...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.96,1:24:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,或者你可以救你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can save your dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.88,1:24:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,时间在流逝啊年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock's ticking, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.63,1:24:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你得想快点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.64,1:24:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,特警要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cavalry's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.18,1:24:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们来不及救你那老父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not in time to do any favors for your old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.56,1:24:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你能救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you can do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.98,1:24:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸?爸爸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad  Dad
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.57,1:24:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有人开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shots fired
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.20,1:24:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,泽克泽克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke... Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.83,1:24:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.92,1:24:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他要跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting away.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.13,1:24:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.80,1:25:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,去快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go... Go
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.73,1:25:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,停下别进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Don't come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.07,1:25:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不要进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.04,1:25:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,噢天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.92,1:25:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是谁干的总有另一个理由某种私人动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did this has another motive, something personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.97,1:25:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did this...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.97,1:25:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是在牵动所有的绳索\N{\fnArial\fs30}...they're pulling all the strings.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.81,1:25:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸就是这一切的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad is the reason for all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.94,1:25:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是当初我想这么做的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's why I wanted to do this in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.77,1:25:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我从十二岁起就梦想着看到这场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been dreaming about this since I was 12 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.61,1:26:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈的是怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is going on
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.51,1:26:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.12,1:26:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下现在就趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down  Get down now
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.75,1:26:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看到你的双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}OFFICER 2: Let me see your hands
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.71,1:26:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别别别住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No  No, no, stop
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.88,1:26:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不要天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No  God
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.09,1:26:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动一不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze  No, no
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.05,1:26:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.09,1:26:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,把它放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it down
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.72,1:26:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your weapon
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.14,1:26:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.08,1:26:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No
